---
const title = 'Health & Safety Disclaimer – WeFitNest';
const description = 'WeFitNest is for general wellness and lifestyle purposes only. It does not provide medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="WeFitNest" />
    <style>
      *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

      body {
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #f9f9f9;
        color: #1a1a1a;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }

      header {
        background: #ffffff;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e8e8;
        padding: 18px 24px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      header .logo {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #4f46e5;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      header .logo span {
        color: #1a1a1a;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 760px;
        margin: 48px auto;
        padding: 0 24px 64px;
      }

      .page-title {
        font-size: 2rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #1a1a1a;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }

      .updated {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: #777;
        margin-bottom: 32px;
      }

      .warning-banner {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 14px;
        background: #fffbeb;
        border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;
        border-radius: 6px;
        padding: 18px 20px;
        margin-bottom: 36px;
      }

      .warning-banner .icon {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        line-height: 1;
      }

      .warning-banner p {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: #92400e;
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }

      h2 {
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #4f46e5;
        margin-top: 40px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        padding-bottom: 6px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0ff;
      }

      p {
        font-size: 0.93rem;
        color: #333;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }

      ul {
        padding-left: 22px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }

      ul li {
        font-size: 0.93rem;
        color: #333;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }

      strong {
        color: #1a1a1a;
      }

      .policy-link {
        color: #4f46e5;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .policy-link:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
      }

      footer {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 24px;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: #aaa;
        border-top: 1px solid #e8e8e8;
        margin-top: 48px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>

    <header>
      <a class="logo" href="/">WeFit<span>Nest</span></a>
    </header>

    <div class="container">

      <h1 class="page-title">Health &amp; Safety Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: May 29, 2026</p>

      <div class="warning-banner">
        <span class="icon">⚠️</span>
        <p>
          WeFitNest is for general wellness and lifestyle purposes only.
          It does <strong>not</strong> provide medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p>By using WeFitNest, you acknowledge and agree to the following:</p>

      <h2>1. No Medical Advice</h2>
      <p>
        The information provided by the App—including workout suggestions, difficulty scoring, nutrition logs,
        and any fitness-related guidance—is <strong>for informational and educational purposes only</strong>.
      </p>
      <p>It should <strong>not</strong> be interpreted as:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Medical advice</li>
        <li>A substitute for professional healthcare</li>
        <li>A personalized nutrition or exercise prescription</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Always consult a qualified physician or healthcare provider before beginning any exercise, diet, or fitness program.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Physical Activity Risks</h2>
      <p>Engaging in physical activity carries inherent risks. By using the App, you confirm that:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>You are voluntarily participating in fitness activities</li>
        <li>You understand the risks of injury, illness, or physical strain</li>
        <li>You assume full responsibility for your health and safety</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        If you experience dizziness, fainting, shortness of breath, chest pain, or any discomfort,
        <strong>stop using the App immediately</strong> and seek medical attention.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Nutrition Logging Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        Nutrition information logged or displayed in the App is <strong>not</strong> intended to replace professional dietary advice.
      </p>
      <p>You should consult a licensed nutritionist or healthcare provider for:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Personalized meal plans</li>
        <li>Medical dietary restrictions</li>
        <li>Weight-loss or weight-gain programs</li>
        <li>Food allergies or intolerances</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Accuracy of Information</h2>
      <p>While we strive to provide accurate and helpful information, WeFitNest:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>May not reflect your individual health needs</li>
        <li>May not account for medical conditions, injuries, or limitations</li>
        <li>Does not guarantee the accuracy of nutrition or fitness data</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        You are responsible for evaluating whether the App's recommendations are appropriate for your personal situation.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Use at Your Own Risk</h2>
      <p>
        You agree that your use of WeFitNest is <strong>at your own risk</strong>.
        WeFitNest and its creators are not liable for:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Injuries</li>
        <li>Health complications</li>
        <li>Damages arising from the use or misuse of the App</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>6. Consult a Professional</h2>
      <p>For any questions regarding your health, fitness level, or nutrition needs, always consult:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>A physician</li>
        <li>A licensed dietitian</li>
        <li>A certified fitness professional</li>
      </ul>

    </div>

    <footer>
      &copy; 2026 WeFitNest. All rights reserved. &nbsp;|&nbsp;
      <a class="policy-link" href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>
      &nbsp;|&nbsp;
      <a class="policy-link" href="/terms-of-use">Terms of Use</a>
    </footer>

  </body>
</html>
